          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. While adding or subtracting two rational numbers having different denominators, how will you make the denominators equal?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.194,
            0.659,
            0.214
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Verify the distributive law for rational numbers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.376,
            0.265,
            0.621,
            0.293
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Exercise Set 3.3"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.306,
            0.742,
            0.423
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Prove that the following rational numbers are equal: (i) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{2}{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{4}{6}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (ii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 5 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 0 } { 8 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (iii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-\\frac{3}{5} and  -\\frac{6}{10}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (iv) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 9 } { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and 3"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.438,
            0.323,
            0.555
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Find the sum: (i) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 2 } { 5 }   +   \\frac { 3 } { 1 0 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (iii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "- { \\frac { 4 } { 7 } }   +   { \\frac { 3 } { 1 4 } }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.549,
            0.464,
            0.675,
            0.511
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 7 } { 1 2 } + \\frac { 5 } { 8 }"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.568,
            0.387,
            0.686
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Find the difference: (i) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 5 } { 6 } { - } \\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (iii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "- { \\frac { 7 } { 9 } } { - \\left( - { \\frac { 2 } { 3 } } \\right) }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.548,
            0.595,
            0.672,
            0.639
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 1 } { 8 }   -   \\frac { 3 } { 4 }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.699,
            0.365,
            0.816
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. Find the product: (i) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{2}{3} \\times \\frac{3}{10}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (iii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 4 } { 7 }   \\times   \\frac { 5 } { 1 4 }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.548,
            0.727,
            0.669,
            0.77
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 7 } { 1 1 }   \\times   \\frac { 5 } { 8 }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.826,
            0.672,
            0.899
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. Find the quotient: (i) "
